@startuml
title 02a - Auth Login
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Auth Service :8091" as AUTH
database "Auth DB" as ADB

FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/auth/login
GW -> AUTH: Forward

AUTH -> ADB: Find user by username + ACTIVE
ADB --> AUTH: User

AUTH -> AUTH: Validate password
AUTH -> AUTH: Validate password expiry

AUTH -> AUTH: Resolve default company
AUTH -> AUTH: Generate accessToken(companyId claim)
AUTH -> AUTH: Generate refreshToken

AUTH -> ADB: Save refresh token
AUTH -> ADB: Update last login metadata

AUTH --> GW: LoginData(profileDetails,\ntokenDetails, defaultCompanyId, companies[])
GW --> FE: 200 Success

@enduml

